                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc5ad761-98af-3f42-97e5-b07b3d560299",
                        "entry_id": "1f743d5a-210e-3199-b47e-712a16065779",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to thicken (intransitive), to get thicker, to swell up"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "092d31fb-39d2-427a-b60b-daa2d80f9f93",
                                "sense_id": "bc5ad761-98af-3f42-97e5-b07b3d560299",
                                "text": "Е́сли нару́шите регуля́рность во́дных процеду́р, то сердцеви́на плода́ утолща́ется, а оболо́чка начина́ет тре́скаться. Поэ́тому, е́сли случи́лся тако́й пери́од за́сухи (по уважи́тельным причи́нам), то не залива́йте сра́зу же по прие́зду гря́дки, что́бы загла́дить свою́ вину́ пе́ред их обита́телями.",
                                "translation": "If you interrupt the regularity of watering procedures then the core of a fruit swells up and the peel begins to crack. So, if such a waterless period should take place (for good reason) then do not water the flowerbeds immediately after your arrival so that you apologize to those dwelling in the flowerbeds.",
                                "english": "If you interrupt the regularity of watering procedures then the core of a fruit swells up and the peel begins to crack. So, if such a waterless period should take place (for good reason) then do not water the flowerbeds immediately after your arrival so that you apologize to those dwelling in the flowerbeds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
